Package: PAUDanalytics
Type: Package
Title: Longitudinal PAUD Observation Analytics
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("PAUD", "Analytics", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "example@example.com")
Description: A modular Shiny application for longitudinal analysis of early childhood observation data across beginning, middle, and end of semester. It summarizes six STPPA-aligned developmental aspects, detects progress, stagnation and decline, maps results to Foundation Phase learning elements, and produces rule-based narrative reports.
